Task
Imagine your organisation plans to expand Agentic AI across marketing and customer experience within the next year.

As a business leader, reflect on how you would guide this transformation responsibly.

Complete the following activities.

Part A: Preserve the Customer Experience
Identify one customer interaction where you believe human involvement should continue, even if AI supports the process.

Explain:

Why is this interaction important?
What value does human judgment add?
Part B: Strengthen Organisational Readiness
Reflect on your organisation's current state.

Identify one capability you would prioritise before scaling Agentic AI, such as:

Customer data quality
CRM integration
Governance
Leadership capability
Workforce skills
Explain why this capability should come first.

Part C: Your Leadership Commitment
Complete the statement below:

"If I were leading Agentic AI adoption in my organisation, the one principle I would insist on throughout the implementation journey is..."

Support your response with practical reasoning and, where appropriate, examples from your own experience.

Estimated Duration: 30 minutes

